---
// Unknown addresses get a real 404. Without this page Cloudflare Pages answered every missing file,
// including style files removed by a deploy, with the start page and status 200, which phones
// then used as the stylesheet.
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="de">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <title>Allo Outings · 404</title>
    <style>
      body { font: 1.05rem/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; background: #f6f5f2; color: #17191b; margin: 0; padding: 48px 20px; text-align: center; }
      b { display: inline-block; background: #ffcc00; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
      a { color: #17191b; }
      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        body { background: #121314; color: #ecebe8; }
        b { color: #17191b; }
        a { color: #ecebe8; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <b>Allo Outings · 小鹿出游</b>
    <p>Diese Seite gibt es nicht. · This page doesn't exist. · 页面不存在。</p>
    <p><a href="/de/">Deutsch</a> · <a href="/en/">English</a> · <a href="/zh/">中文</a></p>
  </body>
</html>
